  "details": "As part of the new item system, and as a companion for **Add items & Item Interactions to Shield Levels¹** and **Add option for \"Allow Item Interactions from\" Permissions²** it is recommendable that culling options, similar to avatars, are added to the Quick Menu for improved safety and performance.\n\nThese options should ideally include:\n\n- Limit nearest number of items to [x]\n\n- Show items within [x] meters\n\n- Always show friends' items [boolean]\n\nThis would allow users to self manage their own experiences with items *beyond* safety, ensuring that items are not unnecessarily shown and allowing them to have minimal performance impact in edge cases where numerous items are spawned.\n\n—\n\n1. https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/items-add-items-item-interactions-to-shield-levels\n\n2. https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/items-add-option-for-allow-item-interactions-from-permissions",
